      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The initial alloy has a non-optimized dislocation structure.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A thermomechanical route combining approximately 50% hot rolling and 70% cold rolling has been applied to this alloy system.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9506522::web::004::1_introduction",
        "PMC9506522::web::012::3_2_performance_of_the_zr7_mea_after_tmt"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The rolling route can be followed by rapid annealing at about 850 °C for 30–50 seconds with a heating rate near 15 K/s.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9506522::web::012::3_2_performance_of_the_zr7_mea_after_tmt"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The thermomechanical treatment will produce an ultra-fine-grained microstructure.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9506522::web::012::3_2_performance_of_the_zr7_mea_after_tmt"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The thermomechanical treatment will create a controlled or balanced dislocation density.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grain refinement caused by the treatment will increase yield strength through the Hall–Petch effect.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rapid annealing will permit partial recovery that preserves ductility.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rapid annealing and the resulting microstructure will optimize or enhance Young’s modulus.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The refined-grain and controlled-dislocation microstructure will improve fracture resistance.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The processed alloy will achieve a yield strength greater than 1200 MPa.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The processed alloy will achieve tensile ductility greater than 15%.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9506522::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The processed alloy will have greater stiffness than the as-cast or conventionally processed alloy.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The processed alloy will have greater toughness or fracture resistance than the as-cast or conventionally processed alloy.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Controlled processing conditions are needed to avoid over-recrystallization.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
